WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.090
Hold a rifle perfectly level
over flat, open ground.

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.530
Fire one bullet straight out.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:10.810
At the same instant, let a second
bullet drop from the same height.

4
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:14.690
The fired bullet streaks
sideways, far across the ground.

5
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.740
The other one simply falls.

6
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.500
Ignore air resistance.

7
00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.070
Which bullet hits the ground first?

8
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.760
In this mission, you'll
roll a ball off a table,

9
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.420
and predict exactly where it lands.

10
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.890
Then you'll kick a ball
upwards at an angle,

11
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.040
and find its maximum height and its range.

12
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.200
Your mission: predict
which bullet lands first,

13
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.520
and explain why.
